      "message": "feat(camera): deliver verified Z19 Linux 1080p capture and live preview\n\nArchive the reviewed camera bit/XSA, original BD/XDC and required IP inputs\nwith SHA256 provenance, isolated project creation and standalone sources.\n\nAdd the Linux DMA driver, capture/JPEG workers, browser MJPEG controls,\nPC loopback viewer, guarded SD recovery/install/load tooling and validated\nAArch64 binaries. Preserve historical ELF archives as separate profiles.\n\nDocument each component, deployment and restart steps, measured results,\nlicenses and remaining limits; keep system images and credentials local.\n\nValidation: SD Python 9 tests and PowerShell 12 guard cases; standalone\nrebuild; Python/PowerShell/shell/Tcl checks; archive/deployment hashes.\nHardware evidence: one SD cold boot, direct SSH/SCP, 600-second CAM0 capture,\nstale/kill/restart handling and 757 full-size JPEGs at 25.16 received fps.\nMatching Vivado 2020.2 synthesis was not rerun; hand control remains pending.",
